WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:23.901
Bang! Bang!

2
00:00:23.902 --> 00:00:27.879
One stormy night a wizard knocked on the door.

3
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.069
The wizard was wet.

4
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:40.888
"Please give me shelter from this rain!"

5
00:00:40.889 --> 00:00:44.703
Tom was in the Throne Room.

6
00:00:44.704 --> 00:00:56.884
Guards brought in the wizard.

7
00:00:56.885 --> 00:00:59.408
"I'm Daimon the wizard.

8
00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:04.614
May I stay here until the rain stops?" he asked.

9
00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:08.036
"Of course!" the king said.

10
00:01:08.037 --> 00:01:12.740
"Warm yourself by the fire, Daimon."

11
00:01:12.741 --> 00:01:16.118
"I will get you a drink," Tom said.

12
00:01:16.119 --> 00:01:19.219
He waved his wand. "Water!"

13
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.594
Poof! A tub of water appeared.

14
00:01:22.595 --> 00:01:26.578
"Oops!" Tom said.

15
00:01:26.579 --> 00:01:30.564
Daimon laughed.

16
00:01:30.565 --> 00:01:34.288
"I don't like water anyway," he said.

17
00:01:34.289 --> 00:01:41.355
"I'd like a hot drink."

18
00:01:41.356 --> 00:01:46.051
Daimon dried off by the fire.

19
00:01:46.052 --> 00:01:50.004
"What a beautiful castle!" he said.

20
00:01:50.005 --> 00:01:51.954
The king smiled.

21
00:01:51.955 --> 00:02:00.407
"I will show you around."

22
00:02:00.408 --> 00:02:04.991
He led Daimon out of the Throne Room.

23
00:02:04.992 --> 00:02:08.738
Tom sighed.

24
00:02:08.739 --> 00:02:12.919
"I bet Daimon never messes up his spells."

25
00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.776
Cat frowned.

26
00:02:14.777 --> 00:02:17.827
"I don't trust that wizard.

27
00:02:17.828 --> 00:02:27.807
I'm going to follow them."

28
00:02:27.808 --> 00:02:31.624
The king was showing Daimon the Grim Dungeon.

29
00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:36.099
The dungeon was dark and damp.

30
00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:41.377
The ceiling dripped.

31
00:02:41.378 --> 00:02:46.595
"No one ever escapes from here!" the king boasted.

32
00:02:46.596 --> 00:02:53.128
Suddenly Daimon flicked his wand. Poof!

33
00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:56.249
The king was trapped inside the dungeon!

34
00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:03.280
Daimon laughed.

35
00:03:03.281 --> 00:03:06.636
"Now you can't escape either.

36
00:03:06.637 --> 00:03:19.526
And I am taking over this castle!"
